  "name": "Comeuppance",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> moderate transmutation; <strong>CL</strong> 9th; <strong>Weight</strong> 50 lbs.; <strong>Price</strong> 8,000 gp</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nThis +1 steel tower shield may not look all that special, but its construction demanded that it be forged in the flames of burning spellbooks, both arcane and divine. Comeuppance can store a single recitation of any level from either the Codex of Heart and Mind or the Codex of Artifice, but this recitation cannot be unleashed except as detailed below. As a readied action, the wielder can counterspell any spell whose spell level is less than or equal to the stored recitation's recitation level and whose school matches the stored recitation's similar school.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Magic Arms and Armor, disdain for the derivative; <strong>Cost</strong> 4,000 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/truenaming-items#toc33\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
